---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Sewer Camera Inspection Sunnyvale | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Video camera drain and sewer inspection in Sunnyvale, CA. Locate clogs, roots, cracks, and damage with clear footage." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Camera Inspection in Sunnyvale</h1>
			<p>See exactly what’s going on inside your drains and sewer lines.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Diagnose Problems with Video</h2>
					<p>Guesswork is expensive. A sewer camera inspection lets us see blockages, root intrusion, cracks, offsets, and collapsed sections in real time. You get a clear picture of the issue and a recommended plan of action.</p>
					<p>Camera inspections are valuable before buying a home, after a major clog, or when problems keep coming back.</p>
					
					<h3>What We Look For</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Location and type of clogs</li>
						<li>Root intrusion into joints</li>
						<li>Cracks, breaks, and separations</li>
						<li>Bellies (low spots) that trap debris</li>
						<li>Scale and grease buildup</li>
						<li>Foreign objects or construction debris</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>When to Request an Inspection</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Recurring clogs in the same line</li>
						<li>Multiple fixtures draining slowly</li>
						<li>Before or after major plumbing work</li>
						<li>Home purchase or sale inspections</li>
						<li>Suspected root or structural damage</li>
					</ul>
					
					<p>Findings are explained clearly, and we can often perform cleaning or further work in the same visit when appropriate.</p>
					
					<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
					<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">Request Quote</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Know What’s in Your Pipes</h2>
			<p>Schedule a camera inspection in Sunnyvale today.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
